  effect='The landlord must return to the district a pro rata portion of the allowance reflecting the balance of the period not used. This is owed to the district, not the tenant, and is not a deduction from the tenant\'s deposit; the district may place another eligible family in the apartment for the balance of the period. The tenant\'s own deposit and account are settled separately under the ordinary rules.',
  dependencies=['NY:GOL-7-108(1-a)(e)'],
